# Release content: the four model files, the README and the released
# experiment artefacts are tracked.  Everything else (smoke tests, reports,
# logs, caches, notebooks) stays local.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!FMO_BSI.py
!FMO_ABSI.py
!FMO_MBSI.py
!FMO_MABSI.py

# Released experiments: KS fusion ablation at three training-set sizes,
# three fusion methods each.  The directory has to be un-ignored level by
# level, because a whitelist pattern never descends into an ignored folder.
!Experiments/
!Experiments/**
Experiments/**/*.tmp
Experiments/**/latest.pt
